  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "E8a / R-149 - an AiPrimitive carrying its OWN parameter resolver, so NOTHING needs to name it: Register(AssetId, ...) and the thunk\u0027s TryRun(AssetId, ...) key on the same value the asset already carries. That is why this case needs no selection property. The Construction graph declares NO inputs and NO outputs (BP1677) - its subject is this asset\u0027s GENERATED Params struct, which no authored TypeId could name without baking the emitted class name into the asset. It reads SpeedKph with Get Parameter and writes SpeedMps with Set Variable: a write V_ResolverPurity permits HERE and nowhere else, because the params region is this resolver\u0027s OUTPUT, not a side effect that would outlive a failed parse.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
